  ✓ Review adequacy, real-program pinning, and every local K declaration/rule
  ✓ Create and run a fresh meaningful false non-vacuity mutation
  ✓ Account for proven versus assumed boundaries and write REVIEW.md/evidence
  → Verify report completeness and exact terminal verdict markers
