The implementation is correct, all reconstructed claims reach `#Top`, and non-vacuity passes. However:

- The priority-40 body bridge can prove a concretely false result on its match domain.
- The proof never consumes `solution.mpy`; a material body mutation leaves the proof at `#Top`.

